# Play test of Vasagatan Remade (CIPlay vasagatan_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the bow
# (Raft's stranded boat) on the sandbar at the lagoon's reef edge (1.1 m), its wheelhouse door at the cabin's back;
# the sunk stern on the ledge in the bay below (13.2 m down); the crew's camp on the west arm's dune shoulder (4 m),
# up the dune from the lagoon's shore.
island Vasagatan Remade
expect step 0
expect title Two Halves of a Ship

# The wheelhouse door won't give without a crowbar
use chartdoor
expect message jammed tight

# From the lagoon's shore up the dune to the crew's camp: the diary, the crowbar
walk -31.5 -17.2 to -33.5 -17.4 to -35.5 -17.6 to -36.6 -17.6 h=4
zone camp
expect step 1
read First mate's diary
expect step 2
open Camp tool chest
expect story crowbar 1
expect step 4

# The safe stays shut without the captain's key
open Captain's safe
expect message The safe is locked
expect step 4

# Down to the sunk stern: the locker in the captain's cabin
at -24 -38.5
zone stern
expect step 5
open Captain's cabin locker
expect story capkey 1
# (no exact step here: the bow's rats may be gone already - a shark or the fall - and their step counted with it)

# The rats in the bow's sand, their king among them
zone bow
expect step 8
kill Rat
expect step 9

# The door forced with the crowbar - the safe is bolted just inside (the boat's doorway is too low to walk through:
# it is opened from the doorway, within Raft's reach of the player's eye)
use chartdoor
expect message swings free
walk -27.2 -27.4 to -26.92 -25.86 h=1.4
reach Captain's safe
open Captain's safe
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_MotorWheel 1
expect item Blueprint_SteeringWheel 1
expect done
